<h1 style="font-size: 28px; color: #4c4b4b;padding-bottom: 0px;"><span id="PageBody_Label1">
View Your Sample Ballot
<!--Search for your Polling Place-->
</span></h1>
<p><br />Please select your municipality, ward and district to see your sample ballot and polling place address. If you do not know your municipality or ward and district, please visit the <a href="https://www.pavoterservices.pa.gov/Pages/PollingPlaceInfo.aspx" target="_blank">Pennsylvania polling place webpage</a> to find it by entering your street address. Polls will be open on Election Day from 7:00 am to 8:00 pm.</p>
<p> Each year, there are polling places that must be moved for a variety of reasons. If the polling place for your ward and district does not show a location, we are currently securing one and will update accordingly when confirmed. Please note that all voters impacted by a polling place change will receive a mailing advising of the new location. </p>
<div id="PageBody_pnlAddr">
	
